<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs Friday actual 98,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs Friday actual 98,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual receipts 98,000 and Saturday's 15,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 per cwt higher than the mid-session Friday. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 47.50 -48.50	   48.50 -49.50</p>
<p>few			   47.00  49.00	   48.00  50.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.     40.00 -41.00	   40.00 -43.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.     42.00 -44.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>	 500 lbs. up	45.00 -49.00	   46.00 -50.00</p>
